sin Download Manager (sinDL)
Copyright 2026 sinDL

This product is a modified version of AB Download Manager
(https://github.com/amir1376/ab-download-manager),
Copyright 2024-present AB Download Manager App, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
sinDL changes its name, look and default settings, and adds features on top of it
(half-price detection, page grabbing, auto extract and repair, video, torrent,
security checks and others).

The installer includes these third-party components:

- JetBrains Runtime (OpenJDK), GPL-2.0 with the Classpath Exception
- libtorrent4j (MIT) and libtorrent (BSD-3-Clause)
- 7-Zip-JBinding and 7-Zip (LGPL-2.1, with the unRAR license restriction:
  the code may not be used to re-create the RAR compression algorithm)
- jsoup (MIT)
- Kotlin, Compose Multiplatform, Ktor, OkHttp, Koin and other libraries
  used by AB Download Manager, under their own licenses (mostly Apache-2.0)

These tools are not included; sinDL downloads them from their official releases
the first time they are needed and checks them against the published SHA-256:

- yt-dlp (Unlicense)
- FFmpeg builds from yt-dlp/FFmpeg-Builds (GPL)
- Deno (MIT)

Iranian IP ranges are derived from the RIPE NCC delegated statistics.
